# Internal tooling — DB schema evolution and one-off/maintenance scripts stay
# local. They're operational history and data-cleanup heuristics, not part
# of the scraper's public product surface.
#
# One directory rule rather than per-filename patterns. The old
# slop_scraper/backfill*.py and slop_scraper/cleanup*.py globs were keyed on
# where the scripts happened to sit, so relocating them would have silently
# made every one of them tracked — the same failure the _local/ rule was
# introduced to end.
migrations/
slop_scraper/maintenance/
description_rollback_*.json

# Kept so the old locations stay ignored if a script is ever restored there.
slop_scraper/backfill*.py
slop_scraper/cleanup*.py
slop_scraper/fix_dates.py
slop_scraper/reheal*.py

